-[15px] leading-relaxed text-gray-300 max-w-md">Badan Penyelenggara Jaminan Produk Halal (BPJPH) <br/>Jl. Raya Pd. Gede No.13, RW.1, Pinang Ranti, Kec Makasar, Kota Jakarta Timur,<br/> Daerah Khusus Ibukota Jakarta 13560</div><div class="pt-1"><h4 class="mb-3 text-xs lg:text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-300">Ikuti Kami</h4><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5 text-gray-300"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/bpjphri" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Facebook BPJPH" class="rounded-xl bg-gray-800 p-2.5 text-gray-300 transition-all hover:bg-emerald-600 hover:text-white hover:scale-105 active:scale-95"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19" height="19" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M128,24A104,104,0,1,0,232,128,104.11,104.11,0,0,0,128,24Zm8,191.63V152h24a8,8,0,0,0,0-16H136V112a16,16,0,0,1,16-16h16a8,8,0,0,0,0-16H152a32,32,0,0,0-32,32v24H96a8,8,0,0,0,0,16h24v63.63a88,88,0,1,1,16,0Z"></path></svg></a><a href="https://www.threads.com/@halal.indonesia" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Threads BPJPH" class="rounded-xl bg-gray-800 p-2.5 text-gray-300 transition-all hover:bg-emerald-600 hover:text-white hover:scale-105 active:scale-95"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19" height="19" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M186.42,123.65a63.81,63.81,0,0,0-11.13-6.72c-4-29.89-24-39.31-33.1-42.07-19.78-6-42.51,1.19-52.85,16.7a8,8,0,0,0,13.32,8.88c6.37-9.56,22-14.16,34.89-10.27,9.95,3,16.82,10.3,20.15,21a81.05,81.05,0,0,0-15.29-1.43c-13.92,0-26.95,3.59-36.67,10.1C94.3,127.57,88,139,88,152c0,20.58,15.86,35.52,37.71,35.52a48,48,0,0,0,34.35-14.81c6.44-6.7,14-18.36,15.61-37.1.38.26.74.53,1.1.8C186.88,144.05,192,154.68,192,168c0,19.36-20.34,48-64,48-26.73,0-45.48-8.65-57.34-26.44C60.93,175,56,154.26,56,128s4.93-47,14.66-61.56C82.52,48.65,101.27,40,128,40c32.93,0,54,13.25,64.53,40.52a8,8,0,1,0,14.93-5.75C194.68,41.56,167.2,24,128,24,96,24,72.19,35.29,57.3